      "description": "Brand  and High Quality\r\nType: Mixing Pitcher for Drinks\r\nMaterial: Plastic\r\nColor: Transparent,Black\r\nSize:  23.8 x 11.5cm(9.37 x 4.53in) / 9.37 x 4.5 inches\r\nCapacity:2000ml\n\nPackage includes: 1PC Mixing Pitcher for Drinks\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1.Practical Mixing Pitcher This mixing pitcher is equipped with self bending plastic blade and plunger, you can smoothly mix and stir any powdered beverages and frozen fruit juice concentrates by simply pulling the plunger to fully blend the beverages.\r\n2.Translucent Mixing Water Pitcher This mixing water pitcher is made of high quality thickened PP, strong and durable, not easy to be damaged. The pitcher has a translucent design, which makes it easy to clearly see how much beverage is left in the pitcher and control the ratio of water.\r\n3.Sealed and Leakproof Both sides of this juice mixing container are sealed with recessed lids, tight and resistant to spills and drips, you can easily rotate the lid to keep it closed and open. You just need to place the lid in the closed position to keep the pitcher in a sealed state, then you can stir the liquid by pulling the plunger.\r\n4.Effortless to Clean This beverage mixing container design is not only effortless to clean but also easy to fill. The removable lid and plunger allow you to easily clean every corner of the pitcher to avoid residue or dirt.\r\n5.Wide Application This 2000ml beverage mixing container is suitable for mixing frozen fruit juice concentrates or beverages, such as fruit juices, tea drinks, milkshakes, chocolate milk, smoothies, iced coffee, lemonade, iced tea, or mixed drinks. You can even use it to make pancake batter which is\r\n\r\nTips:\r\n1.Due to the light and monitors effect, colors may have lightly difference.\r\n2.Please allow slightly size errors due to manual measurement. Thank you for your understanding!\nMixing Pitcher for Drinks Manual Mixing Water Pitcher Wide Mouth Juice Pitcher Drinks Mixing Cup 2000ml with Lid Large Capacity Fridge Drinks Storage Containe  Creativity",
